// The Gemma 3n E2B .task file (~2GB) should be placed in:
//   android/app/src/main/assets/models/gemma_3n_e2b_it.task
//
// Download from: https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-3n-E2B-it-litert-lm
// License: Apache 2.0 (Gemma terms of use apply)
//
// Memory requirements:
//   - Minimum: 2.5GB available RAM
//   - Recommended: 4GB+ available RAM
//   - The model uses conditional parameter loading to skip audio tower
//   - Falls back gracefully when memory is insufficient
//
// To reduce APK size, consider using Android App Bundles with
// Play Asset Delivery for the 2GB model file.
